³1ip³224.221.185.171³2ts³21074373883³2version³21³2name³2text_default³2data³2summary³3Added BillStClair as a contributor³3text³3<b>Self-defense training:</b>
:[[Bujinkan Martial Arts]]: ancient, practical Japanese arts of self defense
:[http://www.frontsight.com/ Front Sight Firearms Training Institute]

<b>Firearms forums:</b>
:[http://www.packing.org/ Packing.org], a great resource for information on carrying concealed firearms
:[http://groups.yahoo.com/group/free-arms/ The Free Arms Project]: "...committed to the development of a patentless, Open Source, Open Engineering personal defense weapon."
:[http://www.thehighroad.org/ The High Road]: [[Oleg Volk]]'s very-active firearms discussion and trading site.

<b>General education (on rights and weapons):</b>
:[http://www.webleyweb.com/heap/ Ken Holder's [[H.E.A.P.]] Site]: "[[Holocaust Education and Prevention]]" resources
:[http://www.rkba.org/ [[RKBA]].org]: [[Jeff Chan]]'s [[Right to Keep and Bear Arms]] resources
:[http://www.jpfo.org/ Jews for the Preservation of Firearms Ownership]: "America's Most Aggressive Defender of Firearms Ownership"
:[http://www.ar15.com/ AR15.com]: incredible resource on the [[AR-15]] rifle and carbine

<b>Books:</b>
:[http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1888766069/survivalarts-20/ Boston's Gun Bible] by [[Boston T. Party]]
:[http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1888118040/survivalarts-20/ Unintended Consequences] by [[John Ross]]
:[http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0873649311/survivalarts-20/ The Art of the Rifle] by [[Col. Jeff Cooper]]
:[http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0873644972/survivalarts-20/ Principles Of Personal Defense] by [[Col. Jeff Cooper]]
:[http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0873649753/survivalarts-20/ Tactical Advantage : A Definitive Study Of Personal Small-Arms Tactics] by [[Gabriel Suarez]]
:[http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0873648641/survivalarts-20/ Tactical Pistol : Advanced Gunfighting Concepts And Techniques] by [[Gabriel Suarez]]
:[http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0873648986/survivalarts-20/ Tactical Shotgun : The Best Techniques And Tactics For Employing The Shotgun In Personal Combat] by [[Gabriel Suarez]]
:[http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1581600496/survivalarts-20/ Tactical Rifle : The Precision Tool For Urban Police Operations] by [[Gabriel Suarez]]
:[http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0879474122/survivalarts-20/ Defensive Shotgun, the Techniques and Tactics] by [[Louis Awerbuck]]

